Description: offline, read-only document viewer
 Sovander opens the files people receive every day: Word, Excel, PowerPoint,
 OpenDocument, PDF, EPUB books, Markdown, text, images and zip archives. It
 only shows them: it never edits a file, needs no account and never goes
 online.
 .
 An AppArmor profile denies Sovander and every process it starts any network
 access, and the app checks that at start. Office files are laid out by
 LibreOffice running headless; PDFs are drawn by MuPDF.
